0 // Colour 71 = light bluish grey (tower shaft), 72 = dark bluish grey (base, platform, parapet)
0 // -Y is up.  Shaft = 6 x 6 studs (x,z from -60..60), pinwheel running bond with 1x4 bricks.
0 // Platform & parapet = 8 x 8 studs (x,z from -80..80).
